A local team of AI agents that works together and learns from experience

Usage: ymp [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  init          Create configuration and discover existing local agent installations
  doctor        Show executable availability. --probe sends a small read-only model request
  run           Run an autonomous team without opening the TUI
  catalog       Read the stored selectable pool, or refresh native metadata without model prompts
  capabilities  Inspect native models and controls without sending a model prompt
  resume        Resume an interrupted team session
  ask           Send a request to a single configured agent (read-only by default)
  sessions      List saved sessions for the current project
  trace         Export a saved session's structured state and complete history as JSON
  config        Show configuration, profile information, or the configuration file path
  reputation    Inspect stored competence observations
  memory        Search verified memory for the current project
  relocate      Reassociate an existing project with a relocated source directory
  demo          Run an entirely local demonstration with three deterministic test agents
  mcp           Public project-scoped MCP server over stdio (read-only unless enabled)
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --home <HOME>  
  -C, --cwd <CWD>    
  -h, --help         Print help
  -V, --version      Print version
